{"title":"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Alice sells an item at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/f/1af88c1534bab510152766fb60851db0c3a5af52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" /> less than the list price and receives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/5/2b56bd637cb2c936d539be1b5000a64a898af389.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> of her selling price as her commission. \nBob sells the same item at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/5/555360df10d7f3448442d43c277f763b0d1236bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" /> less than the list price and receives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> of his selling price as his commission. \nIf they both get the same commission, then the list price is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/0/9604afeadc90b5c60ce512a20b1ba049b98ab446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } \\$20\\qquad \\textbf{(B) } \\$30\\qquad \\textbf{(C) } \\$50\\qquad \\textbf{(D) } \\$70\\qquad \\textbf{(E) } \\$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"452\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is the list price, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/2/23203862aac765ebd110be1b0597f604de1914a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.1(x-10)=0.2(x-20)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"202\" height=\"20\" />. Solving this equation gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/f/55f3f18e15c1e5cb4ab85abcb01eac951b30875b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=30$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/f/2bf670b2d1eeb62eeb5d0ece26d77b36a06dffb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }\\$30}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"73\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME\" title=\"1983 AHSME\">1983 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1983 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1983\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<